"bbox": {"x": 1044.4864862574323, "y": 1260.416666594298, "width": 87.04054054054059, "height": 27.500000000000146}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "36.8（5）", "bbox": {"x": 1044.4864862439586, "y": 1287.916666599265, "width": 82.45945945945955, "height": 22.916666666666586}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "43.6（13）", "bbox": {"x": 1044.4864862701577, "y": 1315.4166665902778, "width": 87.04054054054059, "height": 27.500000000000146}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "20.9", "bbox": {"x": 1301.027027256081, "y": 1228.3333328750002, "width": 50.391891891891945, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "18.7（6）", "bbox": {"x": 1301.027026797973, "y": 1260.4166665902776, "width": 77.87837837837833, "height": 22.916666666666828}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "21.7（3）", "bbox": {"x": 1301.027026783657, "y": 1287.9166665950522, "width": 77.87837837837833, "height": 22.916666666666586}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "15.8 （3）", "bbox": {"x": 1301.0270268332122, "y": 1315.4166665608973, "width": 77.87837837837853, "height": 27.500000000000146}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "• value crystal giah tacor Sal a Seal mere Fobs and cale are the oser ed red esculated structure factors respecively.", "bbox": {"x": 151.17567536032684, "y": 1379.5833333194767, "width": 1356, "height": 59.583333333333364}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Rew value is the same as R value but calculated on 5% of the data not included in the refinement.", "bbox": {"x": 160.14917276988103, "y": 1421.0314842481648, "width": 902.808641175966, "height": 41.54041628042844}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "• Root-mean square deviations of the parameters from their ideal values.", "bbox": {"x": 164.91891868668358, "y": 1457.4999999920428, "width": 668.8378378378379, "height": 22.916666666666586}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "/ Figures in parenthesis indicate number of monomers in each group.", "bbox": {"x": 160.15377582823194, "y": 1477.5707512875913, "width": 641.7013494130728, "height": 30.863057374954273}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "and I in the C222,scn structure and chains h, j, I in the C222, urea structure (chain names refer to the continuous naming convention of all chains in the PDB file). 'The PheB1 orientations in the C2 structures resemble those of the C222, structures. Three out of the six B-chains in each structure have a non-helical conformation. The electron density is generally better defined in these two structures, which is reflected in the crystallographic B-factors. A comparison of the B-factors shows that Pheß1 residues with non-helical conformation have a lower B-factor in three of the four structures, Table 1.", "bbox": {"x": 146.2439413994786, "y": 1544.1550821923256, "width": 678.5732992017593, "height": 353.55333010355616}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "In contrast to the TR, conformation, where B1-B3 have an extended conformation, only resides B1-B2 have a non-helical state. A similar, non-helical conformation of the PheB I residue has previously been observed for one of the B-chains in an R& insulin in complex with resorcinol (PDB ID: LEVR) [11]. In that case, the carbonyl oxygen of PheB1 is coordinating a sodium ion which was further coordinated by the C terminal AsnA21 of a symmetryrelated molecule. In our case, PheB1 is stabilized in a nonhelical conformation by a hydrogen bond between amide nitrogen of PheB1 to the carbonyl oxygen of ThrA8 in a neighboring molecule, or a hydrogen bond between the carbonyl oxygen of Pheßl and the amide nitrogen of AsnB3 in the same chain. There are further interactions with symmetry-related molecules, such as the PheBl amide nitrogen interactions with the OH group of a symmetry-related Tyr/14, or the carbonyl oxygen of CysA20", "bbox": {"x": 146.19267105999492, "y": 1544.2341192669235, "width": 1397.9150464856946, "height": 488.60874811808276}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Page 5 of 14", "bbox": {"x": 1392.6486484195946, "y": 2103.7499999570314, "width": 146.5945945945944, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(page number not for citation purposes)", "bbox": {"x": 1195.662161933108, "y": 2135.833332875, "width": 343.58108108108115, "height": 27.4999999999999}}], "ms": 442.167208}